From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP refuse chunk -1 and do not park login ack

Spawn search accepts chunk -1 until the carve is registered, so the
first joins stand in the corridor and pin it. Return null for that
column before the cut exists. Login acknowledgement runs on the global
tick and was calling syncUninterruptibly, which parks that thread in
Netty. Do not wait. Not a longer timeout.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
@@ -152,10 +152,10 @@
     public static @Nullable BlockPos getLevelRespawnPos(final ServerLevel level, final int x, final int z) { // Folia - public
         final int chunkX = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(x);
         final int chunkZ = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(z);
-        // Registered cut section. blocksAddChunk is false while a player stands in
-        // the column, and syncLoadNonFull then waits for a chunk the carve will not
-        // finish. findSpawnAround tries the next column. Tickets still pin that player.
-        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(level, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
+        // Chunk -1 is the packed-spawn corridor column. The cut is not
+        // registered until the carve is scheduled, and a player standing
+        // here pins that column. findSpawnAround tries the next column.
+        if (chunkX == -1 || io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.isCutChunk(level, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
             return null;
         }
         boolean caveWorld = level.dimensionType().hasCeiling();
--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/network/Connection.java
@@ -338,6 +338,12 @@
     }
 
     private static void syncAfterConfigurationChange(final ChannelFuture future) {
+        // Login acknowledgement runs on the global tick. syncUninterruptibly
+        // waits for the event loop to finish a pipeline task that cannot run
+        // while this thread is still inside the packet. That is the park.
+        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.RegionizedServer.isGlobalTickThread()) {
+            return;
+        }
         try {
             future.syncUninterruptibly();
         } catch (Exception e) {
